{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973050/extras/28309b917c3e65069a1f76d3acf94b99.avif?t=1765529834\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973050/extras/820c0b9d81fe4071db9e33d5f6b951d5.poster.avif?t=1765529834\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973050/extras/820c0b9d81fe4071db9e33d5f6b951d5.webm?t=1765529834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973050/extras/820c0b9d81fe4071db9e33d5f6b951d5.mp4?t=1765529834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Timing is everything. Press the corresponding button the moment a note aligns to score. Your timing accuracy directly affects score and builds combos so consistently precise hits reward higher points and longer combo streaks.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973050/extras/06fd378ef82acfd7e8c26d5dfddb8e24.avif?t=1765529834\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973050/extras/2a4bb985989a639edf96dd2f51f52f89.poster.avif?t=1765529834\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973050/extras/2a4bb985989a639edf96dd2f51f52f89.webm?t=1765529834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973050/extras/2a4bb985989a639edf96dd2f51f52f89.mp4?t=1765529834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <strong>Notes fly from the center towards the four directions: North, South, East, and West. Click in the correct direction when they approach.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973050/extras/69fd7d01e7b236125ef02ef42d68c56c.avif?t=1765529834\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973050/extras/f97c6acdc7b7771b67d6d589994662f3.poster.avif?t=1765529834\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973050/extras/f97c6acdc7b7771b67d6d589994662f3.webm?t=1765529834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973050/extras/f97c6acdc7b7771b67d6d589994662f3.mp4?t=1765529834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The game responds to the music with tightly synchronized visual effects that bring every beat to life. Expect rhythmic pulses, timed flashes, subtle camera movements, and occasional lens distortions that react directly to the soundtrack.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973050/extras/d06b80f10da130fecb040a27738a1a1c.avif?t=1765529834\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973050/extras/0ddecdac2b8ab6bed8590c0ad8d49bfd.poster.avif?t=1765529834\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973050/extras/0ddecdac2b8ab6bed8590c0ad8d49bfd.webm?t=1765529834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973050/extras/0ddecdac2b8ab6bed8590c0ad8d49bfd.mp4?t=1765529834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Drop any song into the game, and Flutterdash will automatically analyze its audio to generate a playable level based on that track. After generation, you can still edit and refine the result. You can customize the difficulty by adjusting the BPM, shifting note positions, tweaking difficulty scaling, and fine-tuning scoring rules.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973050/extras/f70b8afe1450484297453c15b3ba919d.avif?t=1765529834\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>If you want to change the game\u2019s difficulty or just experiment, modifiers let you do that. Each modifier changes core mechanics in a simple way, letting you build challenges that test your speed, precision, or memory. Use them on their own, or combine several together for the toughest challenge.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speed Up</strong>\u00a0-&gt; Increases note speed.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973050/extras/e235b3e5dc8944291884990f92c2ca8d.poster.avif?t=1765529834\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973050/extras/e235b3e5dc8944291884990f92c2ca8d.webm?t=1765529834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973050/extras/e235b3e5dc8944291884990f92c2ca8d.mp4?t=1765529834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hardcore</strong>\u00a0-&gt; No healing.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973050/extras/db05e0b9f4ee2dcd1352c91572a62814.poster.avif?t=1765529834\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973050/extras/db05e0b9f4ee2dcd1352c91572a62814.webm?t=1765529834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973050/extras/db05e0b9f4ee2dcd1352c91572a62814.mp4?t=1765529834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ghost</strong>\u00a0-&gt; Notes are 75% invisible.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973050/extras/a5552efe93f03b01ab0727df615d4d1e.poster.avif?t=1765529834\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973050/extras/a5552efe93f03b01ab0727df615d4d1e.webm?t=1765529834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973050/extras/a5552efe93f03b01ab0727df615d4d1e.mp4?t=1765529834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Shot (Normal)</strong>\u00a0-&gt; Click early, late, or miss, and it\u2019s game over.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973050/extras/a4f0d68d445913ea3cf3e228f0c33ceb.poster.avif?t=1765529834\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973050/extras/a4f0d68d445913ea3cf3e228f0c33ceb.webm?t=1765529834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973050/extras/a4f0d68d445913ea3cf3e228f0c33ceb.mp4?t=1765529834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Shot (Ultra)</strong>\u00a0-&gt; Only perfect timing counts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973050/extras/6994a3c522fa9dc9c3960737b984e0f5.poster.avif?t=1765529834\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973050/extras/6994a3c522fa9dc9c3960737b984e0f5.webm?t=1765529834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973050/extras/6994a3c522fa9dc9c3960737b984e0f5.mp4?t=1765529834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973050/extras/6d2a9e296b416eb5c284e44226f5a673.avif?t=1765529834\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compass-Based Rhythm</strong> <strong>Combat:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a fresh take on rhythm gameplay with a unique compass mechanic. Notes fly outward from the center to the four directions (N, S, E, W), and you must strike them precisely in time with the beat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual Feedback:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a visual effects system that enhances gameplay by applying dynamic camera movements, screen shakes, lens distortion and more. These effects respond to the rhythm and player inputs, creating an immersive and engaging experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automatic Custom Level Creator:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Import your music and let the game auto-generate a level for you. Then, you can fine-tune the BPM, note placements, scoring, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Mod System for Hardcore Players:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from modifiers like Speeding Up, Hardcore, Ghost, One Shot, and One Shot Ultra to ramp up the difficulty and test your precision and focus.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3973050?t=1765529834","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3973050?t=1765529834","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973050/c670416a9c0805d1adef3d4e86e4579734ad6def/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765529834","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973050/c670416a9c0805d1adef3d4e86e4579734ad6def/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765529834","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4048070,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973050/extras/28309b917c3e65069a1f76d3acf94b99.avif?t=1765529834\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973050/extras/820c0b9d81fe4071db9e33d5f6b951d5.poster.avif?t=1765529834\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973050/extras/820c0b9d81fe4071db9e33d5f6b951d5.webm?t=1765529834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973050/extras/820c0b9d81fe4071db9e33d5f6b951d5.mp4?t=1765529834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Timing is everything. Press the corresponding button the moment a note aligns to score. Your timing accuracy directly affects score and builds combos so consistently precise hits reward higher points and longer combo streaks.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973050/extras/06fd378ef82acfd7e8c26d5dfddb8e24.avif?t=1765529834\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay